---
/**
 * The site title, set as type. "With You" turns italic and orchid so the phrase
 * reads as a statement of fact rather than a label.
 */
---

<span class="wordmark">
  Nothing Wrong <em>With You</em>
</span>

<style>
  .wordmark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-paper-50);
    text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgb(224 134 212 / 0.28);
  }
  .wordmark em {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-orchid-400);
  }
</style>
